{"2712700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abduct 'Em", "steam_appid": 2712700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abduct 'Em</strong> is an isometric sandbox roguelike game set after World War 3, where humans have proven not to be the right fit for Earth, becoming the enemies of the planet. Thus, you have been tasked with descending to Earth, destroying the humans, and farming them for their plasma to become more powerful, in order to end their tyranny once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/39f677b51592f5502d43958835565040.poster.avif?t=1776865170\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/39f677b51592f5502d43958835565040.webm?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/39f677b51592f5502d43958835565040.mp4?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c161839a7e2ad2c00972f9e78c4451c7.webp?t=1776865170\" width=1500 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver, dodge, and destroy the humans on your quest to reclaim Earth, making it safe once more without the interference of those pests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c35010be8f13fd4149dcd1c7468efc53.poster.avif?t=1776865170\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c35010be8f13fd4149dcd1c7468efc53.webm?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c35010be8f13fd4149dcd1c7468efc53.mp4?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c161839a7e2ad2c00972f9e78c4451c7.webp?t=1776865170\" width=1500 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abduct and farm the humans for their precious plasma to gain abilities and powers, equipping you for whatever challenges the humans can throw at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy their weapons of mass destruction to foil their plans of ending all forms of life on the precious planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c838424bab7055a99e37c48736804308.poster.avif?t=1776865170\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c838424bab7055a99e37c48736804308.webm?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c838424bab7055a99e37c48736804308.mp4?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c161839a7e2ad2c00972f9e78c4451c7.webp?t=1776865170\" width=1500 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible buildings and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-and-night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable permanent abilities, each having a hefty impact on gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable UFOs, each equipped with a different main attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A host of auto abilities that directly impact how you fight your enemies (EMP, gravity pull, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for your ship and the acquired abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sandbox environment for you to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies ranging from cannon fodder to real threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please email us at : <a href=\"mailto:sourceinformofrevolution@gmail.com\">sourceinformofrevolution@gmail.com</a> if you're interested to review or to get the PR kit. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abduct 'Em</strong> is an isometric sandbox roguelike game set after World War 3, where humans have proven not to be the right fit for Earth, becoming the enemies of the planet. Thus, you have been tasked with descending to Earth, destroying the humans, and farming them for their plasma to become more powerful, in order to end their tyranny once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/39f677b51592f5502d43958835565040.poster.avif?t=1776865170\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/39f677b51592f5502d43958835565040.webm?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/39f677b51592f5502d43958835565040.mp4?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c161839a7e2ad2c00972f9e78c4451c7.webp?t=1776865170\" width=1500 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver, dodge, and destroy the humans on your quest to reclaim Earth, making it safe once more without the interference of those pests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c35010be8f13fd4149dcd1c7468efc53.poster.avif?t=1776865170\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c35010be8f13fd4149dcd1c7468efc53.webm?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c35010be8f13fd4149dcd1c7468efc53.mp4?t=1776865170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c161839a7e2ad2c00972f9e78c4451c7.webp?t=1776865170\" width=1500 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abduct and farm the humans for their precious plasma to gain abilities and powers, equipping you for whatever challenges the humans can throw at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy their weapons of mass destruction to foil their plans of ending all forms of life on the precious planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712700/extras/c838424bab7055a99e37c48736